    <page>
        <paragraphs>
            <title>Mathematical Models</title>
            <p component="b" workspace="3in">
                Another large part of this class that will be relevant throughout the rest of your mathematical career is mathematical models.
            </p>
            <p component="a">
                Another large part of this class that will be relevant throughout the rest of your mathematical career is mathematical models. This is all about writing equations that connect to real world problems. In this chapter, we're looking at linear models.
            </p>
        </paragraphs>

        <sidebyside>
            <image width="60%">
  <prefigure xmlns="https://prefigure.org"
             label="linear-modeling-data-lin">
    <xi:include href="../../prefigure/linear-modeling-data-lin.xml" />
  </prefigure>
</image>
